# Richieste per il servizio orders (porta 3002).

@orders = http://localhost:3002

### Health check
GET {{orders}}/health

### Elenco ordini
GET {{orders}}/orders

### Crea un ordine (atteso: 201, status "pending")
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "anna@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "p-1", "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": "p-2", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Un ordine
GET {{orders}}/orders/o-1

### Ordine senza righe (atteso: 400)
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "anna@example.com",
  "items": []
}
